 "_comment_templates": "templates: one entry per known receipt layout. match = regexes that must all hit; ops run in order and only fill blank fields. op kinds: re+set {path: group | [group(s), type]}, re+vehicle {year,make,model groups -> vehicleCodes}, charges (lines|paired|rows), stop (trip column). cs=true -> case-sensitive. columns cuts a pdftotext -layout page into regions."
